BT /F1 10 Tf 50 263 Td (Use database indexes for lookup fields; avoid repeated queries and oversized results.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 247 Td (Set explicit AI timeouts and handle rate limits; keep secrets out of logs.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 231 Td (Do not cache personalized plans across users. Cache only safe, non-personal assets.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 50 215 Td (Record measurements before optimizing; retest after each material change.) Tj ET
